You have LD access to the CDB project (QA for stages 1–2, PROD for stages 3–4).

The feature code reads the flag and is merged, with the code default set to off.

You know the target release version (e.g. 96.0.0) and have a Jira ticket for the change.

For stages 3–4: the DARIDs of the test users who will verify in pre-prod.

