Rollback and cleanup
Rollback is a targeting change, effective within seconds for active sessions:

One feature: edit the PROD rule to serve false, or turn targeting Off. Off serves the off variation (false here) to both slots.

Never delete the flag to roll back. The UI falls back to the code default, which hides mistakes instead of fixing them.

Cleanup once the feature is fully on in PROD and stable:

Remove the flag check from the code and ship that release.

Archive the flag in LD once no supported app version reads it (mind older mobile versions).

